Experimental bounded exit-flushed Windows host wait diagnostics.
Apply AFTER qemu-iso.patch and qemu-poll.patch to official QEMU v11.1.0
commit84f07211cc5b4fc6a371559bf8a5de4fb068e648.
No scheduling fix or physical correctness is claimed. QEMU_HOST_WAIT_DIAG=1
opts in; 8192 records, >=50ms only, no hot-path I/O. Normal/error-exit dump
freezes writers under BQL first. Forced kill means missing diagnostic dump.
The emulator as a whole remains GPL-2.0-or-later. Original MIT source notices
for modified upstream files follow; the new header has its original MIT tag.

